              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melissa Blach"
            },
            "reviewBody": "First off.. double the batch. I used thin bread slices and 4 soaked it all up! The corn flakes MADE it!! I used Frosted Flakes and it was scrumptious!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-27T18:48:10.303Z"
