            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this with our local bakery's cinnamon swirl bread and cut into nice thick slices. It made 4 slices so I added a couple more eggs and milk with a dash of syrup and made 2 more. It came out nicely crisp and moist. French toast is always made best with day old or drier bread.",
