            "reviewBody": "Made this recipe using loaf sandwich bread that needed to be eaten before going bad. Didn’t use cornflakes because I didn’t have them, but it was still delicious! Only dipped the bread in the egg mixture for a couple of seconds on each side rather than soaking them. Fried them in melted butter and poured maple syrup on top. It was more like dessert and so very delicious!",
