              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TxCin2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This had a nice flavor from the maple and cinnamon. It was plenty sweet. I liked the little crunch the corn flakes brought. It wasn't much but it was there. I cut this in half but ran out of batter so the last piece was a struggle to get covered. I didn't let the bread sit and soak either, I dropped it in, flipped it over, and into the skillet it went. Overall, this was tasty, but rather dry. I could have added syrup to the top, but this was plenty sweet already and did not need more sugar. I'll give this one another try as it was interesting, something a little different, and the flavor was nice.",
